{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"BIT-golang-2026-97031","published":"2026-10-16T08:40:15.509Z","modified":"2026-10-16T09:55:33.249742867Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-97031","GO-2026-6607"],"summary":"Reject malformed ECH outer extension references in crypto/tls","details":"Multiple ECH outer extension references are not permitted under RFC 9849; previously, a client could send a well-crafted packet that could trigger memory exhaustion in the server process by specifying multiple references. We now reject these as malformed and curb the memory amplification vector as a result.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"golang","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/golang"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.26.9"},{"introduced":"1.27.0-0"},{"fixed":"1.27.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/golang/BIT-golang-2026-97031.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://go.dev/cl/847312"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://go.dev/issue/81855"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/U2fTuyDJznI"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-97031"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6607"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:golang:go:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}